A caveat on the illustrations
-----------------------------
The card illustrations were generated with AI (Midjourney), then selected,
edited and assembled by hand. In the United States, material generated by AI
without sufficient human authorship has been held not to attract copyright. The
CC BY 4.0 offer above is made in good faith over whatever rights do subsist in
the selection, editing and arrangement; it is not a warranty that each image is
protected, and in some jurisdictions these images may simply be uncopyrightable.
Credit is appreciated either way. See README.md for the longer discussion.

